    <string name="thanks_muse_desc">Thanks to Muse for development assistance and technical support: the code, features and troubleshooting of this app were completed with the help of Muse.</string>
    <string name="thanks_mp_desc">This app references MP-Manager for its dual-pane side-by-side browsing and cross-pane operations (copy, move, paste to the other pane); the file list row style — small rounded-square icons, names with a “date + size” subtitle; the per-row ⋮ menu and the nine-grid “More actions” panel; the recycle-bin flow with restore and permanent-delete confirm dialogs; the create dialog; the text editor with line numbers and a symbol bar; the recycle bin, bookmarks and pinned folders; Shizuku/root access; compression and extraction, file encryption and decryption; and custom local storages. Thanks to MP-Manager for being open source under GPL-3.0 on GitHub (https://github.com/AbdurazaaqMohammed/MP-Manager), giving this app a design example it could study and follow directly, and thanks to its author AbdurazaaqMohammed for maintaining it and showing that anyone can build a great open alternative to MT Manager.</string>
