    <string name="experimental_warning_title">Experimental Features Warning</string>
    <string name="experimental_warning_msg">Experimental features are still in testing. Using them may cause the following:\n\n• The UI may display incorrectly or glitch, and the app may crash;\n• Some features may be unavailable, or may be changed or removed in later versions;\n• Switching the UI engine reloads the entire app interface immediately;\n• These features may change at any time and are not guaranteed to behave like stable features.</string>
